ONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청 자격 및 선발절차</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업을 희망하는 학기에 조기졸업 신청</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -42.1pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 6</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">건축학부 건축학전공은 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">8</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이상을 등록하고</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업요건을 충족한 자로서 전 학년 성적 평점평균 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">4.30 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이상인 자 </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -42.1pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">석사연계과정자로서 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">7</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>